    "description": "Pens and stables, level 3 of 3: L2 plus flourish 3. Fenced paddock with a gateway (open gap; fence gates are decoration) before an open-sided log stable with two stalls and a feed trough; L2 adds the hay loft, tack corner and water trough, L3 a farrier corner, weathervane, banners and flower boxes. Wants level ground. Not yet builder-tested: anvil, cauldron, dandelion, lightning_rod, moss_carpet, red_wall_banner, spruce_fence_gate. Decoration step adds: armor_stand, potted_plant, water_cauldron.",
